    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\frac{13}{6}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{5(4x+3)-2(x+2)}{10}&=5\\\\20x+15-2x-4&=50\\\\18x+11&=50\\\\18x&=39\\\\x&=\\frac{13}{6}\\end{align*}$$",
